{"3622350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kill Joy", "steam_appid": 3622350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Genre With No Name</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kill Joy</i> is an experiment in complex systems design where a single interaction (swearing) can produce many consequences. That also means that because exploring the rules of the system is the fun part, we won't hold your hand. You'll have to make sense of this insane world yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/528fbe77053faf61e8235240de1bc83a.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/528fbe77053faf61e8235240de1bc83a.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/528fbe77053faf61e8235240de1bc83a.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Swearing is Not Combat — It's How You Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kill Joy</i>, you don’t shoot, punch, or cast spells. <strong>You</strong> <strong>swear</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swearing at creatures is how you interact with this world. Sometimes a creature laughs, sometimes it panics, and sometimes it weeps — and when it cries, the illusion breaks. Every reaction is a <strong>mechanical clue</strong>. Every rude word is a <strong>probe</strong> into the rules of a place that desperately wants you happy, calm, and blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/8ca2678c853b90c78c9035d130033d80.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/8ca2678c853b90c78c9035d130033d80.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/8ca2678c853b90c78c9035d130033d80.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Pastoral Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, this world is a manic dream of rainbow meadows, talking bunnies, and friendly unicorns. Underneath, something is very wrong:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy creatures with glossy, empty eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joyful clouds humming in unsettling harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect little critters who desperately want you to smile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know better.<br>You can feel something gnawing at the edges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/747955c199f61153e60db7491c253bde.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/747955c199f61153e60db7491c253bde.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/747955c199f61153e60db7491c253bde.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Break the Illusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some illusions are “anchored” to certain entities. Their happiness is a spell holding reality together. Make them cry, and the spell cracks. Behind each illusion is something real:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden passages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppressed memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted, half-digested hints left by previous victims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the scattered fragments of <strong>your own mind</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/6f9d6b6a38be180bcd4dabe2a5b8f886.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/6f9d6b6a38be180bcd4dabe2a5b8f886.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/6f9d6b6a38be180bcd4dabe2a5b8f886.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Reassemble Your Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind has been shattered and projected outward onto the landscape. Each dispelled illusion yields:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A question</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fragment of meaning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece them together through small, elegant deduction challenges. Rebuild the logic of your thinking. Recover your identity. Find out what’s eating you — and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/c6ca90576af1dcb6dd827c3702395a4f.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/c6ca90576af1dcb6dd827c3702395a4f.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/c6ca90576af1dcb6dd827c3702395a4f.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re tired of games that tell you what to feel, where to go, and how to think…<br>If you want something genuinely new…<br>If you’re ready to swear at a unicorn until reality fractures —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Kill Joy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Genre With No Name</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kill Joy</i> is an experiment in complex systems design where a single interaction (swearing) can produce many consequences. That also means that because exploring the rules of the system is the fun part, we won't hold your hand. You'll have to make sense of this insane world yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/528fbe77053faf61e8235240de1bc83a.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/528fbe77053faf61e8235240de1bc83a.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/528fbe77053faf61e8235240de1bc83a.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Swearing is Not Combat — It's How You Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kill Joy</i>, you don’t shoot, punch, or cast spells. <strong>You</strong> <strong>swear</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swearing at creatures is how you interact with this world. Sometimes a creature laughs, sometimes it panics, and sometimes it weeps — and when it cries, the illusion breaks. Every reaction is a <strong>mechanical clue</strong>. Every rude word is a <strong>probe</strong> into the rules of a place that desperately wants you happy, calm, and blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/8ca2678c853b90c78c9035d130033d80.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/8ca2678c853b90c78c9035d130033d80.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/8ca2678c853b90c78c9035d130033d80.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Pastoral Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, this world is a manic dream of rainbow meadows, talking bunnies, and friendly unicorns. Underneath, something is very wrong:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy creatures with glossy, empty eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joyful clouds humming in unsettling harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect little critters who desperately want you to smile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know better.<br>You can feel something gnawing at the edges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/747955c199f61153e60db7491c253bde.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/747955c199f61153e60db7491c253bde.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/747955c199f61153e60db7491c253bde.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Break the Illusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some illusions are “anchored” to certain entities. Their happiness is a spell holding reality together. Make them cry, and the spell cracks. Behind each illusion is something real:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden passages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppressed memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted, half-digested hints left by previous victims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the scattered fragments of <strong>your own mind</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/6f9d6b6a38be180bcd4dabe2a5b8f886.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/6f9d6b6a38be180bcd4dabe2a5b8f886.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/6f9d6b6a38be180bcd4dabe2a5b8f886.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Reassemble Your Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind has been shattered and projected outward onto the landscape. Each dispelled illusion yields:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A question</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fragment of meaning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece them together through small, elegant deduction challenges. Rebuild the logic of your thinking. Recover your identity. Find out what’s eating you — and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/c6ca90576af1dcb6dd827c3702395a4f.poster.avif?t=1764862257\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/c6ca90576af1dcb6dd827c3702395a4f.webm?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/extras/c6ca90576af1dcb6dd827c3702395a4f.mp4?t=1764862257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re tired of games that tell you what to feel, where to go, and how to think…<br>If you want something genuinely new…<br>If you’re ready to swear at a unicorn until reality fractures —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Kill Joy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "A systems-driven exploration game where foul language is your only tool — and the world reacts in ways you’d never expect. Escape a deceptive nightmare of rainbows and unicorns by making its happy creatures cry.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/7213c07e8d89e7a6cc5adbe1e656ccadfbc9f815/header.jpg?t=1764862257", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/dee8659c1954756608857351ce328e35241fddf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764862257", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/dee8659c1954756608857351ce328e35241fddf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764862257", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 / RTX 2060 / AMD RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Performance will improve closer to release; specs subject to change.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2025 Over The Moon Games Inc.", "developers": ["Over The Moon"], "publishers": ["Over The Moon"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 65, "description": "Subtitle Options"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/115be9ad6c84c88b0ddc5586eb423e865bbdf5d6/ss_115be9ad6c84c88b0ddc5586eb423e865bbdf5d6.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/115be9ad6c84c88b0ddc5586eb423e865bbdf5d6/ss_115be9ad6c84c88b0ddc5586eb423e865bbdf5d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/8338a7edb605cd28e2d6c5c15de467a463c0b517/ss_8338a7edb605cd28e2d6c5c15de467a463c0b517.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/8338a7edb605cd28e2d6c5c15de467a463c0b517/ss_8338a7edb605cd28e2d6c5c15de467a463c0b517.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/a8e1c5c6cb2c259cc18be2a06e0b1836aabfefc2/ss_a8e1c5c6cb2c259cc18be2a06e0b1836aabfefc2.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/a8e1c5c6cb2c259cc18be2a06e0b1836aabfefc2/ss_a8e1c5c6cb2c259cc18be2a06e0b1836aabfefc2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/e620504e0cffbf3edce0b120d4e5293df1949728/ss_e620504e0cffbf3edce0b120d4e5293df1949728.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/e620504e0cffbf3edce0b120d4e5293df1949728/ss_e620504e0cffbf3edce0b120d4e5293df1949728.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/fc89306109682c73ce1c3217bdce68c747b5ac28/ss_fc89306109682c73ce1c3217bdce68c747b5ac28.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/fc89306109682c73ce1c3217bdce68c747b5ac28/ss_fc89306109682c73ce1c3217bdce68c747b5ac28.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 5, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/d390ff6f54c77e6b9829e5b7e95e5ea17717b1a3/ss_d390ff6f54c77e6b9829e5b7e95e5ea17717b1a3.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/d390ff6f54c77e6b9829e5b7e95e5ea17717b1a3/ss_d390ff6f54c77e6b9829e5b7e95e5ea17717b1a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 6, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/2b08de8bb3a0f45d32855b72bbc8c6bc37b14631/ss_2b08de8bb3a0f45d32855b72bbc8c6bc37b14631.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/2b08de8bb3a0f45d32855b72bbc8c6bc37b14631/ss_2b08de8bb3a0f45d32855b72bbc8c6bc37b14631.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}, {"id": 7, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/7b14804c80dc662724dc8a6018a5b86fa76e17ff/ss_7b14804c80dc662724dc8a6018a5b86fa76e17ff.600x338.jpg?t=1764862257", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622350/7b14804c80dc662724dc8a6018a5b86fa76e17ff/ss_7b14804c80dc662724dc8a6018a5b86fa76e17ff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764862257"}], "movies": [{"id": 257241599, "name": "Announcement", "thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257241599/c86ed6a1ec67ed98d3117b854c292eadcd1ed0f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764862012", "dash_av1": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3622350/706049213/2316a636d5801d2d0063cb20677ce8382cd3aa94/1764810683/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764862012", "dash_h264": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3622350/706049213/2316a636d5801d2d